<title>INDIA: No bids received at India repos auction-RBI.</title>
<headline>No bids received at India repos auction-RBI.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI), the central bank, said on Friday it did not receive any bids at the four-day repos auction.</p>
<p>&quot;No bids was received at the repos auction in government of India dated securities held on May 16,&quot; the RBI said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
